o.","j":22,"h":44,"s":35,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"35:9","t":"And it is Allāh who sends the winds, and they stir the clouds, and We drive them to a dead land and give life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness. Thus is the resurrection.","j":22,"h":44,"s":35,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"35:10","t":"Whoever desires honor [through power] - then to Allāh belongs all honor. To Him ascends good speech, and righteous work raises it. But they who plot evil deeds will have a severe punishment, and the plotting of those - it will perish.","j":22,"h":44,"s":35,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"35:11","t":"And Allāh created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop; then He made you mates. And no female conceives nor does she give birth except with His knowledge. And no aged person is granted [additional] life nor is his lifespan lessened but that it is in a register. Indeed, that for Allāh is easy.","j":22,"h":44,"s":35,"a":11,"sd":null}],"juz":22,"hizb":44,"surahs":[35],"sajdah":false}